"""Preserve six mechanical Abjuration questions and two post-push receipts."""
import json
from prepare_spell_source_cohort import prepare, AUDIT

QUESTIONS = {
    'antimagic-field-lesser': 'Preserve a10ft SPHERE that SUPPRESSES magical effects and spells, Core Action/range10ft/Instantaneous. Resolve sphere radius versus diameter,center/following,finite lifetime/concentration and genuine line/geometry before application. Define exact magical-source eligibility,rank limits if any explicitly NEW,artifact or class-feature exceptions,entry/exit and suppression of objects,ongoing effects,summons,buffs,curses and the field itself. Suppression differs from dispelling and from retroactively reversing completed healing,movement,expenditure or material changes. Bind real parent/rider clocks,spent charges,damage/temporary-HP records and resume behavior; no clock reset,deferred burst or returned ingredient on exit. Resolve casting/cost inside the field,cross-boundary effects and self-overlap using actual source records, not a blanket deletion of all supernatural flavor.',
    'banish-elemental': 'POST-PUSH RECEIPT ONLY. Preserve the complete Elemental OR outsider source,CHA-negates save,Action/60ft/Instantaneous,10RP and actual class-access records. Do not define outsider,origin,destination,return route or the meaning of banishment during this pre-push preparation. This spell joins the existing Banishment dependency for the careful cosmology review after authorized GitHub push and remote-commit verification. No mechanical authoring decision,target taxonomy,selectability or operational approval is inferred from this receipt.',
    'greater-dispel': 'Preserve ending MULTIPLE magical effects in30ft RADIUS, Core Action/range30ft/Instantaneous. Separate point-targeting range from area and define complete finite candidates,sight/line of effect,perception or hidden-effect handling,target choice and maximum or all-effect scope explicitly. Supply source-bound dispel rank/DC/check/outcomes rather than borrowing a familiar game. Determine one roll versus separate rolls,order,whole parent versus one recipient/rider and how an ended barrier affects the initial area snapshot. Compare reviewed Dispel Magic,Dispel Resonance and lesser variants. Do not silently reduce multiple to one, suppress instead of end,delete magic items,undo completed healing/costs/material transformations or reveal protected effects through a free success report. Actual magical sources and separately governed exceptions control eligibility.',
    'spell-resistance': 'Preserve one target receiving ADVANTAGE ON SAVES AGAINST SPELLS for1HOUR, Core Action/60ft/1hour. Define target/willingness,perception/line,cast lifetime and whether concentration is added only as an explicit NEW decision. Identify actual spell-origin saves,including delayed/periodic riders,repeated saves and item casts; distinguish nonspell magical abilities,ordinary hazards,spell attacks and ability checks. Keep ordinary advantage/disadvantage cancellation and nonstacking,not percentage damage resistance or extra rerolls. Cover copied/shared source events,beneficial spells and suppression/reapplication without a fresh hour unless a new paid cast occurs. The title does not grant immunity,damage reduction,AC or opposition to every supernatural source.',
    'wall-of-force': 'Preserve an INVISIBLE,IMPENETRABLE wall, Core Action/60ft/concentration up to one minute. Define finite dimensions,thickness,shape,orientation,support,placement and treatment of occupied spaces. State what impenetrable blocks: actual physical bodies,projectiles,liquids,gas,spell line of effect and other interactions; transparency and invisibility do not decide all these independently. Resolve attacks/object HP if any,dispelling,suppression,existing displacement/teleport rules and explicit source exceptions without importing external Disintegrate behavior or making the wall casually penetrable. Give finite crowding/entrapment,air and ending procedures; no arbitrary crushing damage or new planar barrier. Casting-point range and inability to see the wall do not provide sight through unrelated cover or automatic detection of its boundary.',
    'resonance-barrier': 'Preserve CONVERTING RP into a damage-absorbing shield, Core Action/60ft/concentration up to one minute and base cost10RP. Define eligible recipient(s),ordinary targeting,exact additional RP payment,conversion rate,minimum/maximum,commitment and finite absorption pool. Decide whether the10RP casting cost contributes or remains distinct; no double-spending one payment in several recipients/casts. Bind mitigation order,typed damage,damage sharing,temporary HP,buffer arbitration,remaining pool and expiry/suppression. Shield means a magical absorption effect unless an actual held-equipment profile is explicitly NEW; no implicit armor proficiency,AC or physical shield. Overkill,zero damage,blocked effects,recasts and ending cannot heal,refund RP,recharge spent pool or trigger resource loops. Compare reviewed Resonance Shield/Arcane Ward/Barrier Field actual clauses.',
    'planar-protection': 'POST-PUSH RECEIPT ONLY. Preserve warding an area against creatures FROM A SPECIFIC PLANE, Core Action/60ft/concentration up to one minute,10RP and full class-access records. Do not choose a plane roster,origin classification,planar relationship or ward-entry procedure before the owner\'s post-push cosmology review. This preparation records the dependency without adopting a mechanical substitute,automatically treating creature types as planes,or granting operational access. Review only after authorized push and verified remote commit.',
    'reputation-shield': 'Preserve one target\'s reputation CANNOT BE LOWERED for24HOURS, Core Action/60ft/24hours. Identify actual standing records/factions protected,initial snapshot and the operation of a decrease-blocking rule,including gains during the window,spending standing,opposed factions and external record corrections. Resolve whether prevented decreases vanish or are separately deferred; do not silently create a hidden debt or rollback earned gains. Define target eligibility,perception/line,concentration only if expressly NEW,suppression,expiry and duplicate casts. Compare the supplied Reputation source,which distinguishes institutional standing from morality and magic costs; the whole faction/Haven subsystem still has a separate review gate. Preserve the protective clause without claiming it controls memory,free will,criminal facts,consent or every hostile NPC action. No automatic price entitlement,legal immunity,RP change or alignment effect follows unless explicitly reviewed.'
}


def main():
    coverage = json.loads((AUDIT / 'FOCUSED_SPELL_SOURCE_PREPARATION_COVERAGE.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    assert len(coverage['cohortFiles']) == 15 and coverage['distinctPreparedPendingSpellIds'] == 232
    prepare(
        prefix='ABJURATION_RANK5', title='Rank-five Abjuration source audit', questions=QUESTIONS,
        selector=lambda r: r['operational'] is None and 'Abjuration' in r['schools'] and min(v['rank'] for v in r['classAccess'].values()) == 5,
        expected_count=8, question_prefix='AB5', prior_files=coverage['cohortFiles'] + ['TRANSMUTATION_RANK5_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json'], expected_prior_count=240,
        counterpart_ids=['arcane-ward', 'resonance-shield', 'shield', 'protective-sphere',
                         'dispel-resonance', 'dispel-magic-lesser', 'dispel-magic', 'barrier-field',
                         'faction-seal', 'faction-ward', 'resonance-anchor'],
        pending_ids=['spell-shield', 'ironskin-legion'],
        deferred_ids=['banish-elemental', 'planar-protection'],
        extra_excerpts={
            'DAMAGE_SHARING_PLAYTEST.md': None,
            'CREATURE_LIFECYCLE_PLAYTEST.md': None,
            'HEALING_PULSE_PLAYTEST.md': ['Keep the original clock', 'Targets, payments and separate budgets', 'Finite installments and independent components'],
            'CONTROL_STATES_PLAYTEST.md': ['Root, physical restraints and suppression'],
            'REPUTATION.md': None,
        },
        introduction='Eight full sources retain six pre-push mechanical questions and two unchanged post-push receipts: Banish Elemental and Planar Protection. The latter are excluded from current authoring; no planar taxonomy or destination is reviewed. The six questions preserve actual suppression/dispelling,one-hour advantage,invisible impenetrability,RP conversion and24-hour reputation protection. The supplied Reputation document is existing source evidence, not a claim that the whole faction/Haven audit is complete.',
        future_dispatch='Prepared only while Mining/shared gathering source review is active. Rebase exact dependencies before the six-spell mechanical source conference. Carry Banish Elemental and Planar Protection as unchanged receipts only until the authorized push and verified remote commit; their cosmology review has not started. Source decisions precede authored cards and separate exact review.')


if __name__ == '__main__':
    main()
